Z||000000||THE BEAST||02-14-2001||05:35 PM||||I HAVE BEEN THINKING ABOUT SWAPPING MY 2.8 FOR A 3.8 SC BUT, I HAVE CONCERNS ON WHAT THE WEIGHT DISTRIBUTION WOULD BE. I KNOW THE FIERO HAS SOMETHING LIKE 42/58 OR SO (THAT IS THE EXTREME, A LITTLE MORE LIKE 40/60 IS JUST TOO MUCH) AND I LIKE TO DRIVE PRETTY CRAZY, SO, I DON'T WANT A LOSE MY HANDY CAR  TO GAIN POWER. <P>MY CAR QUALITIES COULD BE IN DANGER! <P>AFTER ALL, BALANCE IS EVERYTHING... <P>DOES ANY ONE KNOW WHAT THE WEIGHT DISTRIBUTION WOULD BE IF I SWAP...OR, DOES ANY ONE KNOW THE WEIGHT OF THE 3.8 SC AND ALSO THE 2.8? <BR>||||reg||5
